WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:02.680
Here's how Stag Hunt works for founders.

2
00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.410
Applying costs nothing.

3
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:06.710
Send your application.

4
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:08.550
It takes about 15 minutes.

5
00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:12.700
Have a one-minute video,
your numbers, and your round ready.

6
00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.100
It isn't public.

7
00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:17.940
Members see it only if they've stated in
writing that they're accredited and will

8
00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:21.380
keep it confidential,
and their check size fits your round.

9
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.000
Stag Hunt's admins can open it too.

10
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:28.510
If a member wants to hear more,
that member reaches out to set up a call.

11
00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.570
If they'd back you, they share
your company with their hunt,

12
00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:34.000
the investors they share deals with.

13
00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:38.120
Each member of that hunt whose check
size fits can answer one question:

14
00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:39.400
want to meet the team?

15
00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:42.890
Each answers before seeing
anyone else's answer.

16
00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:45.970
Anyone who invests does
it directly with your company,

17
00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:47.290
on your terms.

18
00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:50.670
Stag Hunt is not a fund
and takes no fees.

19
00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:54.040
Applying is not a promise
of a call or of investment.

20
00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:57.560
You can apply at staghunts.com.

